  "notes": [
    "Model-facing control vector, from the student's component list (voice, 3 osc, 2 filters, 2 ADSR, 2 LFO, fixed FX chain).",
    "kind: continuous = 0..1 along its curve; categorical = index into options; toggle = 0/1.",
    "A continuous value equals Surge's normalised value (Parameter::get_value_f01) of the mapped Surge parameter, i.e. linear in the curve's Surge units, unless 'surge' says otherwise.",
    "Defaults follow Surge's Init Saw template (the same as Surge's built-in patch defaults).",
    "PROVISIONAL: *_destination / *_depth routing controls are pending the student's decision on modulation routing.",
    "Model I/O: see 'features' in docs/SCHEMA.md (continuous/toggle = 1 feature, categorical = one per option)."
  ],
  "curves": {
    "unit":          { "min": 0,   "max": 1,  "unit": "%",   "display": "percent" },
